# ============================================
# PHASE 2: Compare Vision Output with Expected .txt Files
# Uses elephant to evaluate accuracy of each vision result
# All context passed via filebanks (no chat history reliance)
# ============================================

# --- test1 ---
/filebank1 ${results_prefix}test1_vision.txt
/filebank2 test_images/test1.txt
/model ${judge_model}
/multiline
Compare the vision model output with the expected answer.

Vision model output:
---
{filebank1}
---

Expected answer:
---
{filebank2}
---

Determine if the vision model correctly identified:
1. The subject (exact match or synonym)
2. The color (exact match or close enough)

Respond in exactly this format:
subject_match: <yes|no|partial>
color_match: <yes|no|partial>
explanation: <brief reason>
;;
/multiline
/save ${comparison_prefix}test1.txt
wait 2

