Analyze these 5 comparison results for vision model accuracy.

Comparison 6 (bird1):
{filebank1}

Comparison 7 (cat1):
{filebank2}

Comparison 8 (dog1):
{filebank3}

Comparison 9 (elephant1):
{filebank4}

Comparison 10 (horse1):
{filebank5}

Count the total number of:
- subject_match: yes
- color_match: yes
- subject_match: partial
- color_match: partial
- subject_match: no
- color_match: no

Provide a summary of these 5 in this format:
