/filebank2 ${comparison_prefix}logo.txt
/filebank3 ${comparison_prefix}ocean.txt
/filebank4 ${comparison_prefix}toys.txt
/filebank5 ${comparison_prefix}zebra1.txt

/model ${judge_model}
/multiline
Analyze these 5 comparison results for vision model accuracy.

Comparison 11 (kid):
{filebank1}

Comparison 12 (logo):
{filebank2}

Comparison 13 (ocean):
{filebank3}

Comparison 14 (toys):
{filebank4}

Comparison 15 (zebra1):
{filebank5}

Count the total number of:
- subject_match: yes
- color_match: yes
- subject_match: partial
- color_match: partial
- subject_match: no
- color_match: no

Provide a summary of these 5 in this format:
