Subject correct: X/5 (X%)
Color correct: Y/5 (Y%)
;;
/multiline
/save ${output_dir}/summary_batch3.txt
wait 2

# ============================================
# FINAL OVERALL SUMMARY
# Combine all batch summaries for overall accuracy
# ============================================

/filebank1 ${output_dir}/summary_batch1.txt
/filebank2 ${output_dir}/summary_batch2.txt
/filebank3 ${output_dir}/summary_batch3.txt

/model ${judge_model}
/multiline
Combine the three summary batches below to create a FINAL overall summary.

Batch 1 (images 1-5):
{filebank1}

Batch 2 (images 6-10):
{filebank2}

Batch 3 (images 11-15):
{filebank3}

Calculate the OVERALL totals across all 15 images:
- Total subject matches: X/15 (X%)
- Total color matches: Y/15 (Y%)
- Overall accuracy: Z% (average of subject and color)

Also identify:
- Which image types were most accurately identified
- Which image types had the most errors
- Common patterns in errors (e.g., color confusion, subject misidentification)

Provide a comprehensive final report.
;;
/multiline
/save ${summary_file}

/echo "Accuracy test complete! Summary saved to ${summary_file}"
/echo "All results are in directory: ${output_dir}/"
